## Data

The expired deals catalog (`expired_deals.json`) holds 20 real promos across four categories:

- Food
- Shopping
- Movies
- Travel

Each entry includes:

- Business name, title, and description
- Discount percent or price
- Start and expiration dates
- Redemption instructions
- Image
- Source URL

`DealRepository` loads the file from assets, normalizes image paths and dates, and sorts deals by `daysExpired`.

